      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered a similar or possibly the same issue as this but in VR for the first time recently.\n\nI was in https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4eb40b01-c4b7-4e62-9aa4-74a3a2d6dc37 with my stream camera active and using 3rd person locomotion.\n\nMoving my avatar a certain distance away from my viewpoint would cause a curved alternate camera view to appear in front of my face that moved as if it were attached to my head.\n\nThe issue stopped occurring when I disabled the stream camera and after re-enabling the stream camera I could not reproduce the issue any more.",
